nfjJ pf-131_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-133_">Wine packages are shipped out to our members twice a year in March and November. You will receive an email notification prior to each shipment.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-134_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-135_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="ddf1e4f2-f147-4a6f-95e6-f970d27b4133" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>Billing</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="ddf1e4f2-f147-4a6f-95e6-f970d27b4133" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-137_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-138_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-139_"><p class="sc-gFmZvT AnfjJ pf-140_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-142_">As a member of the wine club, you will be billed on the 15th of each month prior to shipping (February and October) until you cancel (subject to a minimum of 2 shipments.) If you choose wine club membership as a gift you will be billed only for the number of shipments you select (subject to a minimum of 2 shipments).</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-143_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-144_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="e6f970d2-7b41-43b9-bcbd-b473f343086c" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>Still unsure?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="e6f970d2-7b41-43b9-bcbd-b473f343086c" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-146_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-147_